WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:44.210
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:44.480 --> 01:46.760
Tony got someone to pass a message from prison.

3
01:48.040 --> 01:50.000
Zhuang Yan has earned Ma Jingrong's trust.

4
01:51.120 --> 01:52.359
Ma Jingrong offered

5
01:52.879 --> 01:54.000
to break out of prison with Zhuang Yan.

6
01:56.480 --> 01:57.879
So what do we need to do now?

7
01:59.879 --> 02:00.879
A prison break...

8
02:01.120 --> 02:03.519
requires permission from Country M's police.

9
02:06.879 --> 02:09.240
Then we'll play it for real.

10
02:09.840 --> 02:11.280
First, a prison break takes money

11
02:11.560 --> 02:12.520
to bribe the guards.

12
02:13.800 --> 02:15.039
Ma Jingrong told Tony to find someone

13
02:15.039 --> 02:17.080
to collect the money from Li Siqi

14
02:17.080 --> 02:18.400
to bribe the guards.

15
02:18.400 --> 02:19.719
Once the guards are paid off,

16
02:19.719 --> 02:22.080
they'll naturally arrange the breakout.

17
02:24.360 --> 02:26.400
But Jiang Liye is holding Li Siqi.

18
02:27.120 --> 02:28.879
As for who to send to deal with Jiang Liye,

19
02:30.159 --> 02:31.159
I haven't thought of anyone yet.

20
02:33.960 --> 02:36.039
My current cover is Zhuang Yan's wife.

21
02:36.759 --> 02:37.400
Let me go.

22
02:38.400 --> 02:38.800
No.

23
02:39.280 --> 02:41.120
I promised Zhuang Yan I'd keep you safe.

24
02:41.400 --> 02:43.319
Besides, Ma Jingrong lost Jiang Liye's shipment,

25
02:43.560 --> 02:44.960
and Jiang Liye detained Li Siqi.

26
02:45.159 --> 02:46.879
Meeting Jiang Liye right now is extremely dangerous.

27
02:47.680 --> 02:48.400
If I go,

28
02:49.199 --> 02:50.319
I'm the one who can best convince

29
02:50.319 --> 02:51.400
both Jiang Liye and Li Siqi.

30
02:51.719 --> 02:53.400
Zhuang Yan finally got close to Ma Jingrong.

31
02:53.599 --> 02:55.439
Whether we can use this to reach Theerade

32
02:55.439 --> 02:57.000
depends on what we do right now.

33
02:59.560 --> 03:01.000
I know this operation is dangerous,

34
03:01.520 --> 03:03.479
but I came to Country M on a mission,

35
03:03.800 --> 03:04.879
not to be protected.

36
03:11.879 --> 03:12.840
Having you meet Jiang Liye...

37
03:13.639 --> 03:14.479
isn't completely out of the question.

38
03:15.199 --> 03:16.240
Then I'll send two people with you,

39
03:16.479 --> 03:17.479
posing as your assistants.

40
03:18.800 --> 03:19.319
No.

41
03:19.840 --> 03:20.919
If it's truly dangerous,

42
03:21.120 --> 03:22.400
sending more people won't help.

43
03:22.639 --> 03:23.719
It'll only complicate matters.

44
03:24.080 --> 03:25.120
If I go alone,

45
03:26.080 --> 03:27.120
he'll have fewer suspicions.

46
03:27.719 --> 03:28.400
Are you sure?

47
03:31.759 --> 03:32.199
All right.

48
03:33.240 --> 03:34.319
You go meet Jiang Liye.

49
03:34.840 --> 03:36.639
I'll coordinate with the Country M police.

50
03:36.879 --> 03:37.319
Okay.

51
03:51.719 --> 03:52.680
How are you doing, Miss Li?

52
03:52.919 --> 03:54.280
Getting used to it here?

53
03:55.000 --> 03:55.599
Quite well.

54
03:59.000 --> 04:00.879
You've stayed here for days.

55
04:02.120 --> 04:03.199
Aren't you bored at all?

56
04:03.719 --> 04:06.759
Should I find someone to show you around?

57
04:07.280 --> 04:08.039
No need.

58
04:08.560 --> 04:09.919
I prefer peace and quiet anyway.

59
04:10.560 --> 04:12.280
Your place is wonderful, Mr. Jiang.

60
04:12.639 --> 04:14.479
I wouldn't mind staying here long-term.

61
04:15.840 --> 04:18.800
Aren't you worried at all?

62
04:23.480 --> 04:24.680
Life is unpredictable.

63
04:25.279 --> 04:27.279
No one knows what fate lies ahead.

64
04:27.519 --> 04:28.759
If every little thing

65
04:28.759 --> 04:30.000
caused constant worry,

66
04:30.279 --> 04:32.560
wouldn't someone like you, Mr. Jiang,

67
04:34.920 --> 04:36.639
be on edge every single day?

68
04:41.720 --> 04:42.160
Sir.

69
04:43.560 --> 04:46.079
A lady is here asking to see Miss Li.

70
04:50.920 --> 04:51.600
Oh?

71
04:52.040 --> 04:54.879
You have friends in Xilano, Miss Li?

72
04:56.560 --> 04:57.519
In this place,

73
04:58.000 --> 04:59.639
Mr. Jiang is my only friend.

74
05:02.120 --> 05:02.839
Send her away.

75
05:04.240 --> 05:04.600
No.

76
05:07.639 --> 05:08.800
Please let her in.

77
05:09.920 --> 05:11.160
At a time like this,

78
05:11.639 --> 05:13.720
only one person would send someone for me.

79
05:17.040 --> 05:19.879
Then I'll check on your behalf, Miss Li.

80
05:45.360 --> 05:47.839
Wenqing told me all about your situation.

81
05:48.560 --> 05:50.920
However, I still have a few questions.

82
05:51.680 --> 05:53.000
I wonder if you, Miss Ge,

83
05:53.000 --> 05:54.040
could clear them up for me.

84
05:55.199 --> 05:56.079
Please go ahead, Mr. Jiang.

85
05:56.800 --> 05:58.720
What did you and your husband

86
05:59.160 --> 06:01.240
come here for, Miss Ge?

87
06:02.519 --> 06:04.759
We originally came here for a vacation,

88
06:04.920 --> 06:06.199
and also to look into

89
06:06.199 --> 06:07.519
Country M's produce industry.

90
06:09.800 --> 06:11.920
Vacation. Business research.

91
06:11.920 --> 06:12.839
And yet,

92
06:13.639 --> 06:15.879
your husband wound up in prison.

93
06:20.519 --> 06:23.199
I don't know how it came to this either.

94
06:23.759 --> 06:25.279
That's why I find it strange too.

95
06:25.720 --> 06:27.040
You're newcomers here.

96
06:27.800 --> 06:29.240
How did your husband

97
06:29.480 --> 06:31.160
manage to get involved

98
06:32.040 --> 06:34.759
with the local gangs so quickly?

99
06:36.040 --> 06:37.480
After my husband arrived here,

100
06:37.879 --> 06:39.439
he met a man named Tony.

101
06:39.959 --> 06:40.959
But I never expected

102
06:40.959 --> 06:42.279
that he would drag my husband

103
06:42.279 --> 06:43.480
into doing something like that.

104
06:44.120 --> 06:45.399
So you're saying your husband

105
06:45.399 --> 06:46.480
met someone,

106
06:46.800 --> 06:49.160
cast his wife aside,

107
06:49.639 --> 06:54.319
and went off to break the law?

108
06:57.480 --> 06:58.879
Actually, Mr. Jiang, the truth is,

109
06:59.600 --> 07:00.879
only after my husband was arrested

110
07:01.079 --> 07:02.759
did I find out his business back home

111
07:02.759 --> 07:03.439
had been scammed.

112
07:04.560 --> 07:06.279
He ended up owing loan sharks a fortune.

113
07:06.759 --> 07:07.959
Had I known earlier,

114
07:07.959 --> 07:09.639
I never would've let him take such risks.

115
07:11.759 --> 07:12.399
That sounds reasonable.

116
07:13.079 --> 07:15.720
However, I have an alternative theory.

117
07:15.720 --> 07:18.439
I wonder if you'd care to hear it, Miss Ge.

118
07:22.319 --> 07:23.720
Ma Jingrong's underling

119
07:23.720 --> 07:25.959
brought goods to the mainland for a deal,

120
07:25.959 --> 07:27.600
only to get targeted by the police.

121
07:28.000 --> 07:30.120
So the police sent an undercover cop

122
07:30.439 --> 07:32.319
into prison to contact Ma Jingrong.

123
07:32.319 --> 07:33.079
Naturally,

124
07:34.600 --> 07:35.720
the target of the police

125
07:37.639 --> 07:38.920
is Mr. Theerade.

126
07:40.079 --> 07:40.639
As for you

127
07:41.800 --> 07:45.639
and your so-called husband in prison,

128
07:45.839 --> 07:49.519
you're just undercover cops.

129
07:54.319 --> 07:56.040
My theory makes sense too, doesn't it?

130
07:58.279 --> 07:59.399
Mr. Jiang, I really don't know

131
07:59.399 --> 08:00.360
what you're talking about.

132
08:01.079 --> 08:02.519
It was indeed Mr. Ma Jingrong

133
08:02.720 --> 08:03.639
who instructed me through Tony

134
08:03.959 --> 08:05.879
to come here and find Miss Li Siqi.

135
08:07.639 --> 08:09.160
Why should I believe you?

136
08:09.720 --> 08:11.160
I just want to save my husband.

137
08:11.879 --> 08:13.199
So please, Mr. Jiang,

138
08:13.399 --> 08:15.399
could you take me to see Li Siqi?

139
08:16.360 --> 08:16.920
Just now...

140
08:17.879 --> 08:19.279
You just said

141
08:19.600 --> 08:21.720
your husband owes loan sharks a huge debt,

142
08:24.240 --> 08:25.920
and now he's in prison.

143
08:26.199 --> 08:26.959
Do you really think

144
08:27.839 --> 08:30.079
there's any point in staying together?

145
08:31.800 --> 08:33.279
With your looks, Miss Ge,

146
08:33.639 --> 08:34.679
in my eyes,

147
08:35.200 --> 08:37.320
finding a better man

148
08:37.679 --> 08:39.159
wouldn't be a problem at all.

149
08:42.480 --> 08:43.360
I love him very much.

150
08:46.480 --> 08:49.480
Do you know what true love is?

151
08:59.360 --> 09:00.080
Sacrifice.

152
09:22.960 --> 09:24.159
In this gun,

153
09:24.720 --> 09:26.240
there's only one bullet right now.

154
09:26.759 --> 09:28.840
I don't know which trigger pull

155
09:28.840 --> 09:30.360
will fire the bullet.

156
09:31.279 --> 09:34.039
If you really are, as you claim,

157
09:34.360 --> 09:35.879
that in love with your husband,

158
09:38.759 --> 09:41.600
then let me see, Miss Ge,

159
09:43.600 --> 09:44.600
whether you're willing

160
09:46.360 --> 09:49.480
to gamble your life for him.

161
09:53.440 --> 09:55.320
If you dare to pull the trigger,

162
09:56.440 --> 09:58.000
I'll believe you truly love him.

163
09:58.799 --> 10:00.279
Because I don't believe a cop

164
10:00.279 --> 10:02.480
would throw away their life on a mission.

165
10:03.000 --> 10:06.840
But I do believe,

166
10:07.639 --> 10:08.639
just as you said,

167
10:09.559 --> 10:10.679
in the power of love.

168
10:16.120 --> 10:17.480
Whether you save your husband

169
10:17.480 --> 10:18.320
is entirely up to you.

170
10:19.039 --> 10:20.360
If you don't want to do this,

171
10:21.080 --> 10:22.240
you can just turn around and walk away.

172
10:22.240 --> 10:24.480
I'll pretend nothing ever happened.

173
10:26.559 --> 10:28.080
If you really are a cop,

174
10:29.440 --> 10:31.559
don't worry, I won't kill you either.

175
10:33.679 --> 10:34.279
Because,

176
10:36.960 --> 10:38.600
even if I kill one cop,

177
10:39.840 --> 10:41.360
they'll just send others

178
10:41.360 --> 10:42.399
to keep eyes on me.

179
10:51.759 --> 10:52.960
On every mission,

180
10:53.840 --> 10:55.039
I never want to see you get hurt.

181
11:02.960 --> 11:05.279
If danger strikes in future operations,

182
11:05.679 --> 11:06.759
protect yourself first.

183
11:07.080 --> 11:08.200
No matter what happens to me,

184
11:08.360 --> 11:09.080
don't try to save me.

185
11:09.399 --> 11:10.440
All right, I promise.

186
11:11.159 --> 11:13.080
I need you to truly mean it.

187
11:19.720 --> 11:20.320
I promise.

188
11:27.919 --> 11:28.799
I'm just worried about you.

189
11:32.759 --> 11:33.559
Remember what I said.

190
11:34.799 --> 11:36.240
I'll definitely make it back safe.

191
11:38.159 --> 11:38.879
Trust me.

192
11:44.799 --> 11:45.480
Besides,

193
11:46.240 --> 11:47.960
our powerful motherland has our back,

194
11:48.200 --> 11:48.679
doesn't it?

195
12:28.080 --> 12:29.879
Having danced on the edge of death,

196
12:30.600 --> 12:31.720
how does that feel?

197
12:32.759 --> 12:34.440
The moment you pulled the trigger,

198
12:34.759 --> 12:35.960
did you hesitate for even a second?

199
12:37.279 --> 12:38.559
I told you I love him.

200
12:40.360 --> 12:41.600
That's why I have to save him.

201
12:42.919 --> 12:44.279
And what if it kills you this time?

202
12:59.519 --> 13:00.480
You're not a cop.

203
13:01.440 --> 13:02.799
If you were a cop,

204
13:03.039 --> 13:04.159
you'd have pointed that gun at me.

205
13:07.960 --> 13:09.080
I believe you.

206
13:11.639 --> 13:12.120
Goodbye.

207
13:31.360 --> 13:32.519
I'm sorry, Miss Ge.

208
13:33.159 --> 13:34.440
I was just kidding with you.

209
13:46.440 --> 13:48.519
You certainly have character, Miss Ge.

210
13:48.799 --> 13:49.840
I'm sure your husband

211
13:49.840 --> 13:51.200
is no ordinary man either.

212
13:52.279 --> 13:54.440
If you manage to get your husband out,

213
13:54.720 --> 13:55.399
have him come see me.

214
14:01.480 --> 14:02.639
Take her to see Miss Li.

215
14:03.679 --> 14:04.200
Yes, sir.

216
14:06.519 --> 14:06.919
This way, please.

217
14:27.679 --> 14:28.679
The plan is going smoothly.

218
14:29.000 --> 14:29.559
Our operative

219
14:29.559 --> 14:30.879
has earned Ma Jingrong's trust.

220
14:31.279 --> 14:32.440
We can move to the next step.

221
14:32.840 --> 14:35.360
Mr. Mai, what's your next move?

222
14:37.519 --> 14:38.120
A prison break.

223
14:38.679 --> 14:39.480
Are you sure?

224
14:40.759 --> 14:41.799
After Liang Wenbiao woke up,

225
14:41.799 --> 14:44.159
he confessed to the Black Panther Club crimes.

226
14:44.559 --> 14:45.840
Based on his confession,

227
14:46.000 --> 14:47.759
we arrested his drug-dealing subordinates.

228
14:48.039 --> 14:49.240
So far, the number of suspects arrested

229
14:49.399 --> 14:50.279
has reached 17.

230
14:50.440 --> 14:51.679
Also, the casinos run by Liang Wenbiao

231
14:51.679 --> 14:52.879
have all been shut down.

232
14:53.159 --> 14:54.159
The suspects involved

233
14:54.159 --> 14:55.919
are now under our investigation.

234
14:58.279 --> 14:59.320
Can we confirm

235
14:59.480 --> 15:01.159
whether the one dealing with Liang Wenbiao

236
15:01.320 --> 15:02.279
was Four-Legged Snake?

237
15:02.480 --> 15:03.080
No.

238
15:03.559 --> 15:06.279
Liang denied ties to Four-Legged Snake.

239
15:06.399 --> 15:08.039
He said that on the day of the deal,

240
15:08.720 --> 15:10.120
he was only in contact with Li Qiang,

241
15:10.399 --> 15:12.480
and had no idea a third party was involved.

242
15:15.960 --> 15:17.480
Zhou Fuhai committed suicide to escape justice.

243
15:17.799 --> 15:19.240
Li Qiang's whereabouts are unknown.

244
15:20.039 --> 15:21.879
Four-Legged Snake's identity is unknown.

245
15:25.039 --> 15:27.320
Looks like we've hit a dead end again.

246
15:34.360 --> 15:37.879
Weiyuan International was dissolved last month.

247
15:38.840 --> 15:41.559
Gu Xiaoyi's investigation into Chen Hai

248
15:41.559 --> 15:43.799
only proves he laundered money at best.

249
15:45.039 --> 15:46.720
Right now, aside from Qian Feng's testimony,

250
15:47.200 --> 15:48.480
we have no evidence

251
15:49.279 --> 15:51.120
to implicate him in drug trafficking.

252
15:56.919 --> 15:58.399
Chief, Captain Bai, Captain Lu.

253
15:58.679 --> 15:59.919
The forensics report is out.

254
16:00.600 --> 16:01.080
What are the results?

255
16:01.399 --> 16:02.519
None of the DNA samples from Longze Group's

256
16:02.519 --> 16:03.480
security team members

257
16:03.679 --> 16:05.679
matched the samples found on the victim

258
16:05.679 --> 16:06.399
at East Mountain Park.

259
16:06.600 --> 16:08.559
The weapon's trace evidence didn't match either.

260
16:12.960 --> 16:14.960
Was Hu Dong's trace evidence analyzed too?

261
16:15.320 --> 16:16.080
Yes, it was.

262
16:17.440 --> 16:18.519
Suspicions against Chen Hai

263
16:19.480 --> 16:20.440
have been ruled out.

264
16:26.320 --> 16:28.720
We've considered Chen Hai a prime suspect.

265
16:29.519 --> 16:30.279
But now,

266
16:30.840 --> 16:33.919
based on the evidence and facts,

267
16:35.480 --> 16:38.279
we can only release Chen Hai from Detention.

268
16:47.080 --> 16:48.559
Looks like everyone's a bit discouraged.

269
16:49.759 --> 16:52.240
Months of investigation hitting a deadlock,

270
16:54.480 --> 16:55.720
I understand how you feel.

271
16:58.519 --> 17:00.559
In fact, our opponents have been making moves.

272
17:01.200 --> 17:02.759
It looks calm on the surface,

273
17:02.799 --> 17:04.400
but dangerous undercurrents run deep.

274
17:05.519 --> 17:08.279
The fact that Hu Dong took drug money from Zhao Jianfeng

275
17:08.279 --> 17:09.039
is largely established.

276
17:09.240 --> 17:12.359
Four-Legged Snake's contact with Xu Duoduo and Liang Wenbiao

277
17:12.480 --> 17:14.079
is also confirmed by our investigation.

278
17:14.440 --> 17:15.480
All these points...

279
17:15.960 --> 17:17.359
There are plenty of new leads

280
17:17.359 --> 17:18.920
waiting for us to investigate thoroughly.

281
17:19.920 --> 17:21.200
Even if there are no new leads,

282
17:21.359 --> 17:24.079
we will re-examine the facts we already have

283
17:25.000 --> 17:25.599
and find the flaws.

284
17:26.839 --> 17:27.359
I believe that

285
17:28.160 --> 17:29.240
as long as we keep our faith,

286
17:30.000 --> 17:32.079
we will expose these criminals and bring them down.

287
17:35.680 --> 17:36.079
Captain Bai.

288
18:05.079 --> 18:07.519
Your husband is suspected of a major robbery.

289
18:08.119 --> 18:09.640
The police are still investigating the case,

290
18:09.640 --> 18:11.480
so I can't grant your request.

291
18:12.119 --> 18:13.880
Until my husband stands trial,

292
18:13.880 --> 18:15.359
no one can convict him.

293
18:15.839 --> 18:17.160
Under the laws of Country M,

294
18:17.160 --> 18:18.279
I have the right to visit him.

295
18:18.720 --> 18:21.960
Your husband was involved in a severe felony.

296
18:22.640 --> 18:24.680
We not only have the right to see Mr. Zhuang,

297
18:24.799 --> 18:26.279
we also have the right to provide him

298
18:26.279 --> 18:27.000
with legal services.

299
18:27.240 --> 18:28.839
Mr. Zhuang is a Chinese citizen.

300
18:29.880 --> 18:31.079
If in dealing with Mr. Zhuang,

301
18:31.079 --> 18:32.960
you violate the basic spirit of the law,

302
18:34.519 --> 18:37.240
it could trigger a major outcry from Country M's Chinese.

303
18:37.240 --> 18:38.039
Who are you?

304
18:46.079 --> 18:47.599
Country M's Chief Chinese Counsel,

305
18:47.599 --> 18:48.440
Mai Zhaohui.

306
18:49.519 --> 18:51.759
If you don't want any trouble,

307
18:51.920 --> 18:52.960
you'd better arrange

308
18:52.960 --> 18:54.799
a meeting with Mr. Zhuang.

309
19:19.319 --> 19:20.559
What are you doing here?

310
19:21.000 --> 19:22.119
I came to see my husband.

311
19:27.599 --> 19:28.200
All right.

312
19:30.000 --> 19:32.559
Li Siqi doesn't trust the people Tony found.

313
19:32.680 --> 19:34.440
She found someone to help get you out.

314
19:34.640 --> 19:35.920
She wants me to wait with her for you

315
19:35.920 --> 19:36.960
and Mr. Ma to get out.

316
19:37.079 --> 19:39.359
Then we'll go see Mr. Theerade.

317
19:39.680 --> 19:40.279
Listen to me.

318
19:40.440 --> 19:42.119
All of this is my business.

319
19:42.799 --> 19:44.160
Don't get involved.

320
19:44.640 --> 19:46.359
I'm going to wait for my husband myself.

321
19:46.680 --> 19:47.559
No matter what happens,

322
19:48.759 --> 19:50.319
I'll stand by you through life and death.

323
19:51.559 --> 19:53.000
Please send my wife back to China.

324
19:53.119 --> 19:54.759
Mr. Zhuang, please calm down.

325
19:54.920 --> 19:55.519
Sit down.

326
19:57.480 --> 19:58.640
I'm not leaving.

327
19:59.359 --> 20:00.200
Tonight,

328
20:00.400 --> 20:01.640
I'll go meet with Li Siqi

329
20:01.720 --> 20:02.799
and Qin Mu.

330
20:04.079 --> 20:04.920
Tony's men

331
20:05.599 --> 20:06.599
will find a way

332
20:06.680 --> 20:08.640
to pass word to you on what we decide.

333
20:08.640 --> 20:09.519
Until then,

334
20:10.799 --> 20:12.440
get to know the surroundings here well.

335
20:12.680 --> 20:13.599
Qin Mu?

336
20:14.799 --> 20:16.759
How did you get mixed up with them?

337
20:17.200 --> 20:18.519
I'll come back to see you.

338
20:20.720 --> 20:21.440
Mr. Zhuang.

339
20:22.400 --> 20:23.599
Your wife is quite remarkable.

340
20:24.119 --> 20:25.119
I really envy you.

341
20:34.519 --> 20:35.000
Take care.

342
20:38.839 --> 20:39.519
You too.

343
21:08.960 --> 21:10.279
I've coordinated with the Xilano police

344
21:10.279 --> 21:11.640
on the prison break.

345
21:12.079 --> 21:13.039
They've agreed to it.

346
21:13.599 --> 21:14.480
On one condition:

347
21:14.680 --> 21:15.880
there can be no casualties.

348
21:19.359 --> 21:19.920
Understood.

349
21:21.319 --> 21:22.160
Be careful.

350
21:25.160 --> 21:25.720
Now go.

351
21:44.279 --> 21:45.240
When you left,

352
21:45.680 --> 21:47.440
did Jiang Liye have anyone tail you?

353
21:48.440 --> 21:48.960
No.

354
21:49.920 --> 21:50.559
In a matter like this,

355
21:50.599 --> 21:52.359
he'll definitely keep himself out of it.

356
21:55.319 --> 21:56.559
Still, someone like Jiang Liye

357
21:56.680 --> 21:58.079
is suspicious by nature.

358
21:58.680 --> 22:01.240
He rarely takes anyone at their word.

359
22:02.119 --> 22:03.559
The one he trusts isn't me.

360
22:04.240 --> 22:04.880
It's her.

361
22:14.440 --> 22:15.599
So you're Ge Xiaobai.

362
23:46.960 --> 23:47.400
Who are you?

363
23:48.480 --> 23:50.759
You'd better tell me who you are first.

364
23:52.279 --> 23:53.799
Boss Qin sent you, right?

365
23:54.839 --> 23:56.240
You're an undercover cop.

366
24:02.759 --> 24:03.839
This is your gun.

367
24:04.839 --> 24:05.720
I checked it.

368
24:06.200 --> 24:07.200
There are no bullets in it.

369
24:13.440 --> 24:14.359
About what happened today...

370
24:14.960 --> 24:16.759
you'd better not tell your superior.

371
24:17.680 --> 24:19.079
When the time is right,

372
24:19.359 --> 24:20.720
Country M Police Headquarters

373
24:20.759 --> 24:22.240
will explain everything to your superior.

374
24:23.400 --> 24:24.880
Right now, the Xilano Police Department

375
24:24.880 --> 24:26.759
has moles for Theerade and Piyazi.

376
24:27.079 --> 24:27.839
Some of them,

377
24:28.240 --> 24:30.480
even your superior might not know about.

378
24:33.000 --> 24:33.839
From now on,

379
24:34.079 --> 24:35.240
you'll need to cooperate with me.

380
24:39.759 --> 24:42.920
This is a special order from Country M Police.

381
24:43.640 --> 24:46.200
Remember to destroy it once you've read it.

382
24:58.799 --> 25:00.119
If someone wants to get into your room,

383
25:00.160 --> 25:01.359
there are plenty of ways.

384
25:02.799 --> 25:03.599
Be careful from now on.

385
25:20.279 --> 25:21.759
Poison their cellmates,

386
25:22.079 --> 25:23.400
and have them sent to the infirmary.

387
25:24.920 --> 25:26.039
Once the infirmary doctors

388
25:26.119 --> 25:27.559
see their lives are in danger,

389
25:27.799 --> 25:29.359
they'll contact the nearest hospital.

390
25:29.440 --> 25:31.000
Could it actually be life-threatening?

391
25:31.079 --> 25:32.519
They'll show signs of dying,

392
25:32.799 --> 25:35.200
but it's just an effect of the drug.

393
25:35.440 --> 25:36.599
Within two hours,

394
25:36.759 --> 25:38.240
once the drug breaks down in their body,

395
25:38.440 --> 25:39.559
they'll be completely fine.

396
25:47.400 --> 25:48.480
What do you think you're doing?

397
25:48.480 --> 25:49.200
I'm sorry, boss! My mistake!

398
25:49.279 --> 25:50.759
It's my fault, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

399
25:51.400 --> 25:52.160
Boss, I deserve to die!

400
25:52.319 --> 25:53.240
I was wrong, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

401
25:53.440 --> 25:54.319
Boss, I was wrong!

402
25:54.359 --> 25:54.880
I deserve to die!

403
25:55.200 --> 25:56.599
I deserve to die! I deserve to die!

404
25:57.559 --> 25:58.160
I'm sorry, boss!

405
25:58.160 --> 25:59.279
I was wrong! I'm truly sorry!

406
25:59.279 --> 26:00.000
I'm so sorry!

407
26:00.000 --> 26:00.720
I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

408
26:00.720 --> 26:01.359
I'm sorry, boss!

409
26:01.880 --> 26:02.519
Please, I beg you!

410
26:02.960 --> 26:04.880
Let me get you another bowl of soup!

411
26:05.039 --> 26:06.880
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

412
26:07.960 --> 26:10.400
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

413
26:11.759 --> 26:12.279
I'm sorry!

414
26:33.279 --> 26:34.920
We just need to get an ambulance

415
26:34.960 --> 26:36.119
smoothly into the prison,

416
26:36.160 --> 26:39.039
so poisoning anyone will work.

417
27:03.759 --> 27:05.559
Officer! Officer!

418
27:21.279 --> 27:23.400
Mind your own business. Keep eating.

419
27:30.480 --> 27:31.799
But this kind of illusion

420
27:32.039 --> 27:33.799
can only fool ordinary eyes.

421
27:34.160 --> 27:36.119
We also need to bribe the prison doctor.

422
27:37.440 --> 27:40.119
Fine. I'll pay whatever it takes.

423
27:43.200 --> 27:43.960
What's the situation?

424
27:44.200 --> 27:44.839
Not sure yet.

425
27:49.359 --> 27:51.400
Call an ambulance! Hurry!

426
27:52.039 --> 27:52.640
Warden,

427
27:52.799 --> 27:54.640
an inmate has had a sudden emergency.

428
27:54.799 --> 27:56.759
The doctor says he needs resuscitation now.

429
27:57.720 --> 27:59.279
Once the ambulance reaches the prison

430
27:59.279 --> 28:00.519
and picks up the three of them,

431
28:01.039 --> 28:01.799
Mr. Qin,

432
28:02.119 --> 28:04.640
your men can intercept it en route.

433
28:06.599 --> 28:08.319
They're high-security convicts.

434
28:09.440 --> 28:11.000
During transport,

435
28:11.119 --> 28:13.039
the prison will send at least two guards

436
28:13.039 --> 28:13.759
to watch them.

437
28:14.960 --> 28:18.000
Plus the escort cars in front and behind,

438
28:18.480 --> 28:20.079
we won't have any chance

439
28:20.240 --> 28:21.480
to intercept that ambulance.

440
28:22.000 --> 28:22.960
And even if

441
28:22.960 --> 28:24.759
we successfully intercept the ambulance,

442
28:25.880 --> 28:27.440
during the subsequent rescue,

443
28:27.920 --> 28:28.680
there'll still be plenty of

444
28:28.720 --> 28:30.319
unforeseen complications.

445
28:33.279 --> 28:34.119
So,

446
28:34.519 --> 28:36.000
we must make sure the police

447
28:36.079 --> 28:37.599
don't come out with the ambulance.

448
28:41.200 --> 28:43.359
We'll intercept the ambulance as planned,

449
28:43.680 --> 28:44.440
except

450
28:44.480 --> 28:46.599
it'll be on its way to the prison.

451
28:47.319 --> 28:48.160
Get out of the car!

452
28:49.759 --> 28:51.119
Officer, please don't kill me!

453
29:07.039 --> 29:09.759
According to my husband's prison file,

454
29:09.799 --> 29:11.799
he's an electrical engineer.

455
29:12.599 --> 29:13.799
The prison's backup generator

456
29:13.839 --> 29:15.640
is usually run during peak hours,

457
29:15.720 --> 29:16.279
which is

458
29:16.319 --> 29:18.880
between one and five in the afternoon.

459
29:18.960 --> 29:20.799
We need to tamper with it beforehand

460
29:21.000 --> 29:22.279
so that when it starts up,

461
29:22.319 --> 29:23.160
it malfunctions.

462
29:23.920 --> 29:25.559
The generator was made in China,

463
29:25.759 --> 29:27.920
the guards will have my husband check it.

464
29:28.559 --> 29:30.359
Of course, to ensure it goes smoothly,

465
29:30.519 --> 29:31.960
we'll still need to pay off

466
29:32.000 --> 29:33.440
the head guard on duty that day.

467
29:34.720 --> 29:35.759
Money is not a problem.

468
29:55.440 --> 29:56.519
Are you Chinese?

469
29:59.039 --> 30:00.920
Our generator broke down.

470
30:00.920 --> 30:02.839
Can you fix a generator?

471
30:04.440 --> 30:06.079
He's asking if you can fix the generator.

472
30:08.680 --> 30:10.200
Great. You two, come with me.

473
30:11.359 --> 30:12.200
Tell him...

474
30:12.359 --> 30:13.480
...I need another helper.

475
30:14.440 --> 30:16.359
He says he needs another helper.

476
30:16.880 --> 30:18.920
Ask who in here is willing to help him.

477
30:26.200 --> 30:26.720
Okay.

478
30:27.640 --> 30:28.160
Listen up!

479
30:43.839 --> 30:45.599
Can this be fixed?

480
30:46.720 --> 30:48.160
He's asking if it can be fixed.

481
31:07.279 --> 31:08.000
Two hours.

482
31:08.160 --> 31:09.319
And some tools.

483
31:10.319 --> 31:11.359
It'll take two hours.

484
31:11.599 --> 31:12.920
He needs some repair tools.

485
31:14.559 --> 31:16.960
Give him what he needs.

486
31:22.200 --> 31:24.039
When the ambulance enters the prison,

487
31:24.079 --> 31:25.480
we need to spend some money

488
31:25.640 --> 31:27.319
to get two prison gangs

489
31:27.319 --> 31:28.680
to start a riot.

490
32:15.599 --> 32:17.359
There's a riot in the yard.

491
32:17.599 --> 32:19.880
All personnel, provide backup!

492
32:19.880 --> 32:21.920
Make sure it's fixed within an hour.

493
32:42.559 --> 32:43.440
From the electrical room,

494
32:43.519 --> 32:45.559
you can get into the infirmary's ceiling.

495
33:19.079 --> 33:20.240
You're finally here.

496
34:00.839 --> 34:01.640
What happened to me?

497
34:04.160 --> 34:05.119
Where am I?

498
34:13.440 --> 34:14.760
Are you sure something is wrong with him?

499
34:21.199 --> 34:21.960
What's the situation?

500
34:22.360 --> 34:23.519
His condition has stabilized.

501
34:23.800 --> 34:25.760
No, or rather, this guy isn't sick at all.

502
34:40.440 --> 34:42.039
Did you drug yourself

503
34:42.039 --> 34:43.840
to try and escape?

504
34:44.199 --> 34:45.079
I don't know.

505
34:49.719 --> 34:50.679
You can go now.

506
35:24.880 --> 35:26.199
The key to this operation

507
35:26.400 --> 35:28.280
is whether we can adapt flexibly

508
35:28.440 --> 35:29.599
to whatever we encounter that day,

509
35:29.639 --> 35:31.639
every potential human obstacle.

510
35:31.960 --> 35:33.280
So we must get in advance

511
35:33.280 --> 35:34.760
every prison guard's duty roster,

512
35:34.960 --> 35:36.360
and pinpoint their exact positions.

513
35:37.000 --> 35:39.199
Most critical are the guards at the gate.

514
35:39.320 --> 35:40.760
If they intercept us at the end,

515
35:41.280 --> 35:42.599
it'll all be for nothing.

516
35:47.519 --> 35:48.159
Stop.

517
35:54.719 --> 35:56.079
We're not needed here anymore.

518
36:07.960 --> 36:08.960
Open the gate and let them through.

519
36:19.000 --> 36:21.039
In coordination with Interpol,

520
36:21.519 --> 36:24.519
Chinese and Country M police managed to

521
36:24.639 --> 36:26.840
get Zhuang Yan inside the drug cartel.

522
36:29.599 --> 36:31.880
Reporting. Mission accomplished.

523
36:32.199 --> 36:35.480
In three hours, announce a prison break.

524
36:35.719 --> 36:36.360
Yes, sir.

525
36:37.960 --> 36:40.599
This is the daunting task they are facing.

526
36:40.840 --> 36:43.280
Yeah, it always has been.

527
37:13.960 --> 37:14.840
Why are you out of bed?

528
37:15.400 --> 37:16.280
The doctor said

529
37:16.440 --> 37:17.719
you still need to rest for a while.

530
37:19.360 --> 37:21.840
Four-Legged Snake and Liang played Li Qiang.

531
37:22.760 --> 37:24.039
He'll definitely seek revenge.

532
37:24.360 --> 37:25.320
Right now,

533
37:25.840 --> 37:26.920
if we find Four-Legged Snake,

534
37:26.960 --> 37:28.719
we might have a chance to catch Li Qiang.

535
37:30.000 --> 37:32.639
Did Liang say where Four-Legged Snake is?

536
37:34.400 --> 37:34.960
No.

537
37:41.519 --> 37:42.280
Where are you going?

538
37:42.840 --> 37:45.000
Captain Bai said you can't act on your own.

539
37:45.400 --> 37:46.119
Officer Li.

540
37:46.480 --> 37:47.199
I need to see Liang Wenbiao.

541
37:48.039 --> 37:48.880
Our captain said

542
37:49.039 --> 37:50.119
no one is allowed to see him.

543
37:50.920 --> 37:52.159
Officer Li! Officer Li!

544
37:52.719 --> 37:53.159
Officer Li!

545
37:58.599 --> 38:01.159
Are you teaming up with Four-Legged Snake against Li Qiang?

546
38:01.559 --> 38:02.800
Where is he right now?

547
38:22.760 --> 38:24.599
I'm asking you, where is he right now?

548
38:24.639 --> 38:25.239
Li Xiao.

549
38:25.360 --> 38:25.920
Talk!

550
38:26.039 --> 38:26.800
Li Xiao! Li Xiao!

551
38:26.840 --> 38:27.440
Answer me!

552
38:27.480 --> 38:28.079
Li Xiao, calm down!

553
38:28.159 --> 38:28.719
Where is he? Talk!

554
38:28.719 --> 38:29.679
Calm down!

555
38:29.760 --> 38:30.199
I'm asking you!

556
38:30.199 --> 38:31.400
Li Xiao, calm down!

557
38:31.400 --> 38:32.280
Where is he right now?

558
38:32.280 --> 38:32.960
You need to calm down!

559
38:35.159 --> 38:36.039
I already asked him.

560
38:36.400 --> 38:37.559
Now isn't the right time.

561
39:03.760 --> 39:04.440
I'm sorry.

562
39:39.880 --> 39:40.559
What is it?

563
39:40.760 --> 39:41.239
Captain Lu.

564
39:41.800 --> 39:43.639
I suspect Liang's medication was swapped.

565
39:44.199 --> 39:45.559
The suspect is heading toward the elevator.

566
39:46.559 --> 39:47.360
Got it.

567
39:51.800 --> 39:53.039
Secure Liang Wenbiao's medicine.

568
39:53.239 --> 39:54.199
Don't let anyone touch it.

569
39:54.239 --> 39:54.599
Yes, sir.

570
39:54.639 --> 39:55.719
We've got a situation. Follow me!

571
40:41.239 --> 40:41.719
Cuff him.

572
40:51.199 --> 40:51.679
Take him away.

573
41:14.639 --> 41:15.159
Brother Rong.

574
41:21.599 --> 41:22.400
I knew

575
41:23.000 --> 41:24.360
you'd send someone to break me out.

576
41:26.480 --> 41:27.159
And I knew

577
41:27.760 --> 41:29.679
you'd find a way to come see me.

578
41:30.519 --> 41:31.760
Thank you, Mr. Qin.

579
41:32.440 --> 41:33.159
Don't mention it.

580
41:36.400 --> 41:37.440
You must be that...

581
41:37.519 --> 41:39.000
infamous robber.

582
41:40.760 --> 41:42.159
That's right, that's right.

583
41:42.199 --> 41:45.960
Make that two infamous robbers.

584
41:47.760 --> 41:49.159
Are you really just a businessman?

585
41:54.440 --> 41:55.199
Mr. Zhuang,

586
41:55.840 --> 41:57.400
you'll soon be wanted by the police.

587
41:58.159 --> 41:59.920
You can never go back to your old life.

588
42:00.440 --> 42:01.159
How about this?

589
42:01.400 --> 42:02.440
Why don't the two of you

590
42:02.519 --> 42:05.400
join me and Mr. Ma to partner with Mr. Jiang?

591
42:09.840 --> 42:10.880
I'm sorry, sir.

592
42:11.559 --> 42:12.840
After everything that's happened,

593
42:13.119 --> 42:13.960
my husband and I

594
42:14.239 --> 42:15.840
just want a quiet life.

595
42:16.519 --> 42:18.400
Besides, we know nothing about your business.

596
42:25.400 --> 42:26.000
All right.

597
42:26.440 --> 42:27.320
To each their own.

598
42:27.760 --> 42:29.480
I won't force you two.

599
43:04.880 --> 43:06.039
Mr. Jiang gave orders

600
43:06.480 --> 43:07.840
for all of you to go see him.

601
43:09.880 --> 43:11.360
If Mr. Jiang is inviting us,

602
43:12.880 --> 43:14.679
is all this force really necessary?

603
43:14.679 --> 43:15.920
You carry a lot of weight, Mr. Qin.

604
43:16.360 --> 43:17.800
We were worried that with fewer men,

605
43:18.440 --> 43:19.440
you wouldn't come along.
